<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#S5.T2" title="In 5.3 Comparative Summary ‣ 5 Case Studies ‣ ESAA: Event Sourcing for Autonomous Agents in LLM-Based Software Engineering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> presents a quantitative comparison of the two case studies.</p>
</div>
