<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Representative Extract from <span id="A5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">activity.jsonl</span> (CS2: clinic-asr)</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following extract illustrates concurrent multi-agent execution in the <span id="A5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">clinic-asr</span> event store (lines 58–68), showing Claude Opus 4.6 claiming five tasks simultaneously:</p>
</div>
